## OpenSpec review points

Follow [the specification workflow](spec-workflow.md). Direct Backlog and
`backlog-lean` normally use the primary agent, with review on request or an
approved specific trigger. For `backlog-design`, the recommended review points
are the completed proposal/spec/design before dependent implementation, and the
implementation/evidence before change closure. The guide's approved policy
determines which calls are enabled and whether independent review is required.
Schema selection alone is not delegation authorization.
